Package: CompreSSoR
Type: Package
Title: Reference-Anchored Compressed Summary Statistics
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Fergus", "Hamilton", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "fh6520@users.noreply.github.com")
Author: Fergus Hamilton [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Fergus Hamilton <fh6520@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: Convert genome-wide association study summary statistics into a
    reference-anchored, block-indexed Parquet store with compact q9/SE10
    numeric encoding, exact p-values, validation metadata, and an optional
    q8 framed binary cache for repeated regional and MR access.
URL: https://github.com/gushamilton/CompreSSoR
BugReports: https://github.com/gushamilton/CompreSSoR/issues
